Problem: Remove Duplicates from Sorted Array (LC 26)

Pattern: Two Pointers (Read Pointer + Write Pointer)

Approach:

1. Initialize:
   * left = 0 (last unique element)
   * right = 1 (scans the array)
2. Traverse the array using right.
3. If nums[right] is different from nums[left]:
   * Increment left.
   * Copy nums[right] to nums[left].
4. Continue until right reaches the end.
5. Return left + 1 (number of unique elements).

Time Complexity: O(n)

Space Complexity: O(1)
